":\"## CUDA Graph\\n术语是什么？\\nCUDA Graph 是 NVIDIA 自 CUDA 10 起提供的框架，允许开发者将一系列 GPU 操作（kernel launch、memory copy、memset 等）及其依赖关系预先定义为一个有向无环图（DAG），然后通过单次调用在 GPU 上重放整个图。CUDA Graph 的核心优势是消除重复的 kernel launch 和同步开销：传统模式下每次 kernel launch 需要 CPU→GPU 通信（约 5-20μs/kernel），而 graph replay 只需要一次 launch，所有操作及其依赖关系已在 GPU 端处理。CU…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA Dynamic Parallelism (CDP).md\",\"basename\":\"CUDA Dynamic Parallelism (CDP)\",\"score\":3488.269644851942,\"foundWords\":[\"cuda\",\"cudadevrt\",\"cudadevicesetlimit\",\"cudadevicesynchronize\",\"cudalimitmallocheapsize,\",\"cudalimitmallocheapsize\",\"cudalaunchdevice\",\"graphs\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernel）可以通过\",\"kernel）。但在\",\"kernel，cdp\",\"kernel，无需\",\"kernel（parent\",\"kernel（如根据数据稀疏性跳过计算）；\",\"kernel。cdp\",\"`kernel\",\"launch\",\"concurrent\",\"stream\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":42},{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":71},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":131},{\"match\":\"kernel，无需\",\"offset\":148},{\"match\":\"kernel（parent\",\"offset\":167},{\"match\":\"kernel）可以通过\",\"offset\":181},{\"match\":\"cudaLaunchDevice\",\"offset\":194},{\"match\":\"`kernel\",\"offset\":218},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":247},{\"match\":\"kernel。CDP\",\"offset\":268},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":285},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":297},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":314},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":324},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":339},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":351},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":369},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":382},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":434},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":491},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":559},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":586},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":634},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":642},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":649},{\"match\":\"cudaDeviceSynchronize\",\"offset\":673},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":707},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":735},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":834},{\"match\":\"kernel（如根据数据稀疏性跳过计算）；\",\"offset\":935},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":998},{\"match\":\"kernel）。但在\",\"offset\":1018},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1066},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1087},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1103},{\"match\":\"kernel，CDP\",\"offset\":1110},{\"match\":\"cudadevrt\",\"offset\":1223},{\"match\":\"cudadevrt\",\"offset\":1254},{\"match\":\"cudaDeviceSetLimit\",\"offset\":1288},{\"match\":\"cudaLimitMallocHeapSize,\",\"offset\":1307},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1351},{\"match\":\"launch\",\"offset\":1358},{\"match\":\"launch\",\"offset\":1410},{\"match\":\"Concurrent\",\"offset\":1497},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":1508},{\"match\":\"Graphs\",\"offset\":1569}],\"excerpt\":\"## CUDA Dynamic Parallelism (CDP)\\n术语是什么？\\nCUDA Dynamic Parallelism（CDP，CUDA 动态并行）是 NVIDIA 自 Kepler 架构（SM 3.5+）起支持的 GPU 硬件特性，允许 GPU kernel 在设备端动态发射子 kernel，无需 CPU 参与。父 kernel（parent kernel）可以通过 `cudaLaunchDevice` 或直接调用 `kernel<<<grid, block, smem, stream>>>(args)` 发射子 kernel。CDP 天然支持父 kernel 与多个子 kernel…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Out-of-Order Kernel Scheduling (GPU Runtime).md\",\"basename\":\"Out-of-Order Kernel Scheduling (GPU Runtime)\",\"score\":2407.6128410118154,\"foundWords\":[\"cuda\",\"cudalaunchkernel\",\"cudastreamsynchronize\",\"graphs\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernel到kernel\",\"kernel.write_segments:\",\"kernel.id\",\"kernel,\",\"kernel_id,\",\"kernel，则立即将其发射执行，而非等待排在它前面的所有\",\"launch\",\"launch/synchronization\",\"concurrent\",\"stream\",\"stream_id\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":16},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":69},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":97},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":137},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":194},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":216},{\"match\":\"kernel，则立即将其发射执行，而非等待排在它前面的所有\",\"offset\":233},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":263},{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":283},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":288},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":301},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":386},{\"match\":\"launch/synchronization\",\"offset\":393},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":449},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":475},{\"match\":\"kernel_id,\",\"offset\":557},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":570},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":628},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":724},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":798},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":854},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":881},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":918},{\"match\":\"kernel.write_segments:\",\"offset\":980},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1152},{\"match\":\"kernel,\",\"offset\":1187},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1197},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1239},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1269},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1286},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1295},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1311},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1384},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1431},{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":1540},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1545},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1606},{\"match\":\"cudaLaunchKernel\",\"offset\":1638},{\"match\":\"kernel,\",\"offset\":1655},{\"match\":\"stream_id\",\"offset\":1663},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1687},{\"match\":\"cudaStreamSynchronize\",\"offset\":1702},{\"match\":\"stream_id\",\"offset\":1724},{\"match\":\"kernel.id\",\"offset\":1788},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1938},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":1974},{\"match\":\"kernel到kernel\",\"offset\":2010},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":2115},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2227},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2318},{\"match\":\"launch\",\"offset\":2325},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2465},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":2493},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2500},{\"match\":\"Concurrent\",\"offset\":2602},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":2613},{\"match\":\"Graphs\",\"offset\":2674}],\"excerpt\":\"## Out-of-Order Kernel Scheduling (GPU Runtime)\\n术语是什么？\\nOut-of-Order Kernel Scheduling（GPU 运行时乱序 kernel 调度）是 ACS 提出的核心机制，在 GPU 运行时对顺序发射的 kernel 进行乱序并发调度。与 CPU 乱序指令调度类似，ACS 在固定大小的调度窗口内对已发射但尚未执行的 kernel 进行运行时依赖检查——若一个 kernel 不依赖任何未完成的 kernel，则立即将其发射执行，而非等待排在它前面的所有 kernel 完成。这种机制使原本在单 CUDA stream 中串行的小 kernel 能够并发执行，从…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Persistent Threads (GPU).md\",\"basename\":\"Persistent Threads (GPU)\",\"score\":953.2252954444953,\"foundWords\":[\"cuda\",\"graphs\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernel必须按最\\\"重\\\"的task配置\",\"kernel必须按最\",\"kernel（如接触力计算）配置的\",\"kernel（如碰撞检测）被迫使用为重量\",\"kernel。\",\"launch\",\"launch配置:\",\"launch配置\",\"launch（cuda\",\"concurrent\",\"stream\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":83},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":133},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":177},{\"match\":\"launch\",\"offset\":184},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":266},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":365},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":425},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":452},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":520},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":554},{\"match\":\"kernel必须按最\",\"offset\":1294},{\"match\":\"launch配置:\",\"offset\":1318},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1547},{\"match\":\"kernel（如碰撞检测）被迫使用为重量\",\"offset\":1581},{\"match\":\"kernel（如接触力计算）配置的\",\"offset\":1602},{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":1761},{\"match\":\"launch（CUDA\",\"offset\":1794},{\"match\":\"launch\",\"offset\":1906},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1959},{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":2000},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":2005},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2038},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":2057},{\"match\":\"kernel。\",\"offset\":2079},{\"match\":\"Concurrent\",\"offset\":2102},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":2113},{\"match\":\"Graphs\",\"offset\":2174}],\"excerpt\":\"Persistent Threads（PT，持久线程）是 GPU 编程中的一种范式，其中单个 kernel 持续驻留在 GPU 上，其线程不断从工作队列中拉取 task 执行，而非传统的\\\"一个 kernel 完成后退出的 fire-and-forget\\\"模式。PT 通过消除反复的 kernel launch 开销（5-20μs/次）和 CPU-GPU 同步来提升性能，特别适合由大量短小、动态生成的 task 组成的 workload。PT 的核心设计是在 kernel 中使用 while 循环持续轮询 task queue，取到 task 后根据 task 描述符执行相应计算。但 PT 的根本限制是**同质性假设**——所有 task 必须在同一个 kernel 内执行，共享相同的寄存…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Command Processor (GPU CP).md\",\"basename\":\"Command Processor (GPU CP)\",\"score\":407.8251242754209,\"foundWords\":[\"cuda\",\"graphs\",\"kernel\",\"launch\",\"concurrent\",\"stream\",\"stream`\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":84},{\"match\":\"launch\",\"offset\":91},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":106},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":177},{\"match\":\"launch\",\"offset\":184},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":235},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":252},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":331},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":354},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":368},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":391},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":411},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":451},{\"match\":\"launch\",\"offset\":699},{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":737},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":1518},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2087},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2136},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2159},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":2183},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":2223},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2235},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":2272},{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":2459},{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":2472},{\"match\":\"Stream`\",\"offset\":2477},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":2545},{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":2592},{\"match\":\"Concurrent\",\"offset\":2622},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":2633},{\"match\":\"Graphs\",\"offset\":2694}],\"excerpt\":\"Command Processor（CP，命令处理器）是 GPU 硬件中负责从命令队列中取 kernel launch 包、解码并分派 kernel 到计算单元执行的硬件模块。在现代 NVIDIA GPU 架构中，CPU 通过 PCIe 上的 MMIO 区域（设备映射内存）将 kernel launch 包写入用户模式命令队列（command queue），CP 按序从队列头部取包解码，将 kernel 分派到 GPU 的 kernel dispatch unit 进行 SM 级别的调度。每个命令队列由一个独立的 CP 服务，多队列可通过 HyperQ 等技术支持来自不同队列的 kernel 并发执行。CP 仅跟踪队列中的 kernel 顺序，不拥有 kernel 间数据依赖信息——…\"}],\"totalCount\":5,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"path:knowledge_notes CUDA Graph kernel launch concurr