t":1687},{"match":"cudaStreamSynchronize","offset":1702},{"match":"stream_id","offset":1724},{"match":"kernel.id","offset":1788},{"match":"stream","offset":1938},{"match":"stream","offset":1974},{"match":"kernel到kernel","offset":2010},{"match":"stream","offset":2115},{"match":"kernel","offset":2227},{"match":"kernel","offset":2318},{"match":"launch","offset":2325},{"match":"kernel","offset":2465},{"match":"stream","offset":2493},{"match":"kernel","offset":2500},{"match":"Concurrent","offset":2602},{"match":"Kernel","offset":2613},{"match":"Graphs","offset":2674}],"excerpt":"## Out-of-Order Kernel Scheduling (GPU Runtime)\n术语是什么？\nOut-of-Order Kernel Scheduling（GPU 运行时乱序 kernel 调度）是 ACS 提出的核心机制，在 GPU 运行时对顺序发射的 kernel 进行乱序并发调度。与 CPU 乱序指令调度类似，ACS 在固定大小的调度窗口内对已发射但尚未执行的 kernel 进行运行时依赖检查——若一个 kernel 不依赖任何未完成的 kernel，则立即将其发射执行，而非等待排在它前面的所有 kernel 完成。这种机制使原本在单 CUDA stream 中串行的小 kernel 能够并发执行，从…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Persistent Threads (GPU).md","basename":"Persistent Threads (GPU)","score":953.2252954444953,"foundWords":["cuda","graphs","kernel","kernel知识笔记","kernel必须按最\"重\"的task配置","kernel必须按最","kernel（如接触力计算）配置的","kernel（如碰撞检测）被迫使用为重量","kernel。","launch","launch配置:","launch配置","launch（cuda","concurrent","stream"],"matches":[{"match":"kernel","offset":83},{"match":"kernel","offset":133},{"match":"kernel","offset":177},{"match":"launch","offset":184},{"match":"kernel","offset":266},{"match":"kernel","offset":365},{"match":"kernel","offset":425},{"match":"kernel","offset":452},{"match":"kernel","offset":520},{"match":"kernel","offset":554},{"match":"kernel必须按最","offset":1294},{"match":"launch配置:","offset":1318},{"match":"kernel","offset":1547},{"match":"kernel（如碰撞检测）被迫使用为重量","offset":1581},{"match":"kernel（如接触力计算）配置的","offset":1602},{"match":"CUDA","offset":1761},{"match":"launch（CUDA","offset":1794},{"match":"launch","offset":1906},{"match":"kernel","offset":1959},{"match":"CUDA","offset":2000},{"match":"stream","offset":2005},{"match":"kernel","offset":