{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_03_Bwp7JLinKOGwA82Z0d6g6641","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/GSPMD (General and Scalable Parallelization for ML Computation Graphs).md\",\"basename\":\"GSPMD (General and Scalable Parallelization for ML Computation Graphs)\",\"score\":41.75634313392669,\"foundWords\":[\"collective\",\"collectivepermute\",\"permute\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"collective\",\"offset\":303},{\"match\":\"CollectivePermute\",\"offset\":373},{\"match\":\"collective\",\"offset\":1352},{\"match\":\"collective\",\"offset\":1528},{\"match\":\"collective\",\"offset\":1940}],\"excerpt\":\"…型编程与并行化：用户编写单设备程序，仅对少量关键 tensor（通常 <1% 的图中 tensor）添加 sharding annotation，GSPMD 编译器自动推导全图的分区方案并插入必要的 collective communication（AllReduce/AllGather/ReduceScatter/All-to-All/CollectivePermute），生成等价但已并行化的 SPMD 程序。支持的并行范式：Data Parallelism（batch 维度切分）、In-layer Model Parallelism（权重切分）、Spatial Partitioning（图像维度切分）、Weight-update/Optimizer-state Sharding、Pipeline Parallelism（经由 wrapper library 归约为 tensor sha…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/NCCL.md\",\"basename\":\"NCCL\",\"score\":40.84940801956856,\"foundWords\":[\"collective\",\"permute\",\"permute/repack。\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Collective\",\"offset\":67},{\"match\":\"collective\",\"offset\":1943},{\"match\":\"permute/repack。\",\"offset\":2101}],\"excerpt\":\"NCCL (NVIDIA Collective Communications Library) 是 NVIDIA 开发的高性能多 GPU 集合通信库，提供优化的 all-reduce、all-gather、reduce-scatter、broadcast、all-to-all 等集合通信原语。NCCL 为 NVIDIA GPU 拓扑（NVLink、NVSwitch、InfiniBand）做了专门优化，使用 ring、tree、collnet 等算法。在 MoE 训练的 EP 中，NCCL 提供 A2A 通信的实现。\\n从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在kernel调度的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Dispatch-Combine Pattern (MoE Expert Parallelism).md\",\"basename\":\"Dispatch-Combine Pattern (MoE Expert Parallelism)\",\"score\":34.71354949161603,\"foundWords\":[\"collective\",\"collective。高效变体：deepep\",\"permute+通信消除显式重排\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"collective。高效变体：DeepE\",\"offset\":977},{\"match\":\"permute+通信消除显式重\",\"offset\":1065}],\"excerpt\":\"标准实现依赖 NCCL All-to-All collective。高效变体：DeepEP (NVSHMEM kernel)、Triton-Distributed (compiler 层融合通信计算)、FUSCO (融合 permute+通信消除显式重排)。vLLM/SGLang 推理变体用 all-reduce 替代 all-to-all（activaion 全复制, expert 权重按 EP 分布）。\\n涉及论文标题：\\n- Least-Loaded Expert Parallelism: Load Balancing An Imbalanced Mixture-of-Experts\"}],\"totalCount\":3,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"path:knowledge_notes XLA TPU VLIW SPMD scratchpad collective-permute codegen\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a29aacc-9739-4962-99fa-5f81938fe8b5","uuid":"55a008ca-a835-4124-9e65-e05527be5a62","timestamp":"2026-05-31T06:57:53.963Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/GSPMD (General and Scalable Parallelization for ML Computation Graphs).md\",\"basename\":\"GSPMD (General and Scalable Parallelization for ML Computation Graphs)\",\"score\":41.75634313392669,\"foundWords\":[\"collective\",\"collectivepermute\",\"permute\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"collective\",\"offset\":303},{\"match\":\"CollectivePermute\",\"offset\":373},{\"match\":\"collective\",\"offset\":1352},{\"match\":\"collective\",\"offset\":1528},{\"match\":\"collective\",\"offset\":1940}],\"excerpt\":\"…型编程与并行化：用户编写单设备程序，仅对少量关键 tensor（通常 <1% 的图中 tensor）添加 sharding annotation，GSPMD 编译器自动推导全图的分区方案并插入必要的 collective communication（AllReduce/AllGather/ReduceScatter/All-to-All/CollectivePermute），生成等价但已并行化的 SPMD 程序。支持的并行范式：Data Parallelism（batch 维度切分）、In-layer Model Parallelism（权重切分）、Spatial Partitioning（图像维度切分）、Weight-update/Optimizer-state Sharding、Pipeline Parallelism（经由 wrapper library 归约为 tensor sha…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/NCCL.md\",\"basename\":\"NCCL\",\"score\":40.84940801956856,\"foundWords\":[\"collective\",\"permute\",\"permute/repack。\"],\"matches\":[{\"mat