2288},{"match":"TMA","offset":2299},{"match":"TMA","offset":2320},{"match":"TensorMap","offset":2332},{"match":"TensorMap","offset":2353},{"match":"TMA描述符常驻于constant","offset":2390},{"match":"memory或寄存器（每个128字节），由host端`cuTensorMapEncodeTiled`创建","offset":2408},{"match":"TMA需配合","offset":2473},{"match":"TMA传输需注意shared","offset":2510},{"match":"memory","offset":2525},{"match":"Tensor","offset":2578}],"excerpt":"## Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA)\n术语解释\nNVIDIA Hopper架构引入的异步数据搬运单元，用于在GPU全局内存（HBM）和流多处理器（SM）的共享内存之间执行高效的异步批量数据传输。TMA替代了传统CUDA编程中由线程显式执行的内存拷贝指令（如cp.async），将数据搬运负载从CUDA Core转移到专用硬件单元。\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nTMA（Tensor Memory Accelerator）是NVIDIA H100/H800/H200 GPU（Hopper架构）中的专用固定功能硬…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Asynchronous Memory Copy (async-copy).md","basename":"Asynchronous Memory Copy (async-copy)","score":10327.923627291411,"foundWords":["tma","tensor","memory","memory-compute","accelerator","async","async-copy：","async-copy","asynchronous","copy","copy。在","copy→drain","copy→steady","hopper"],"matches":[{"match":"Asynchronous","offset":3},{"match":"Memory","offset":16},{"match":"Copy","offset":23},{"match":"async-copy","offset":29},{"match":"Asynchronous","offset":50},{"match":"Memory","offset":63},{"match":"Copy","offset":70},{"match":"async-copy","offset":76},{"match":"async","offset":167},{"match":"memory","offset":215},{"match":"memory","offset":231},{"match":"copy","offset":307},{"match":"copy","offset":321},{"match":"memory","offset":377},{"match":"async-copy","offset":453},{"match":"async","offset":543},{"match":"async","offset":560},{"match":"async-copy","offset":670},{"match":"async-copy","offset":878},{"match":"async-copy：","offset":945},{"match":"async","offset":999},{"match":"async","offset":1062},{"match":"async","offset":1110},{"match":"async","offset":1165},{"match":"copy。在","offset":1196},{"match":"async-copy","offset":1247},{"match":"memory-compute","offset":1364},{"match":"async","offset":1446},{"match":"copy→steady","offset":1504},{"match":"copy","offset":1544},{"match":"Tensor","offset":1552},{"match":"copy→drain","offset":1575},{"match":"Hopper","offset":1622},{"match":"Tensor","offset":1643},{"match":"Memory","offset":1650},{"match":"Accelerator","offset":1657},{"match":"TMA","offset":1670},{"match":"tensor","offset":1683},{"match":"Tensor","offset":1789}],"excerpt":"## Asynchronous Memory Copy (async-copy)\n术语是什么？\nAsynchronous Memory Copy (async-copy) 是 NVIDIA Ampere 架构（A100, Compute Capability 8.0）引入的硬件加速异步数据搬移机制，底层 PTX 指令为 `cp.async`（硬件实现为 LDGSTS）。该机制允许 GPU thread 发起 global memory → shared memory 的数据传输后立即继续执行后续指令，数据搬移在后台由专用硬件（类似 SM 内的 DMA engine）异步完成。支持 4/8/16…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined).md","basename":"Software Pipeline (T.Pipelined)","score":795.9441811469052,"foundWords":["tma","tma（tensor","tensor","memory","accelerator","accelerator）硬件单元","async","copy","copy）与计算（如","hopper"],"matches":[{"match":"memory","offset":165},{"match":"copy）与计算（如","offset":172},{"match":"Copy","offset":312},{"match":"Copy","offset":329},{"match":"async","offset":398},{"match":"copy","offset":421},{"match":"async","offset":431},{"match":"async","offset":455},{"match":"Hopper","offset":476},{"match":"TMA（Tensor","offset":492},{"match":"Memory","offset":503},{"match":"Accelerator）硬件单元","offset":510},{"match":"async","offset":539},{"match":"async","offset":778},{"match":"async","offset":870},{"match":"async","offset":922},{"match":"async","offset":974},{"match":"async","offset":998},{"match":"async","offset":1050},{"match":"async","offset":1102},{"match":"async","offset":1189},{"match":"async","offset":1340},{"match":"async","offset":1372},{"match":"async","offset":1409},{"match":"async","offset":1441},{"match":"async","offset":1498},{"match":"async","offset":1592},{"match":"Hopper","offset":1692},{"match":"TMA","offset":1716},{"match":"async","offset":1862},{"match":"tensor","offset":1873},{"match":"async","offset":1985},{"match":"tensor","offset":1996},{"match":"async","offset":2331},{"match":"async","offset":2566},{"match":"Hopper","offset":3033}],"excerpt":"Software Pipeline（软件流水线）是 TileLang 中的 T.Pipelined 调度原语，用于将循环体内的数据搬移（如 global→shared memory copy）与计算（如 GEMM/attention）重叠执行，通过异步硬件机制隐藏内存延迟。TileLang 的 Pipeline 机制自动分析循环体内语句的 buffer 使用依赖关系，生成结构化的 interleaved schedule：将前后相邻 iteration 的 Copy 和 GEMM 交错执行（Copy(i+1) 与 GEMM(i) 重叠）。在不同 GPU 架构上自动选择最优硬件路径：(1) Ampere (A100) — cp.async 异步 global→shared copy + cp.async.commit_group + cp.async.wait…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Dot-Product Engine (DPE) in HLX.md","basename":"Dot-Product Engine (DPE) in HLX","score":739.7486162113719,"foundWords":["tma","tma-based","tma（warp-specialized","tensor","memory","accelerator","async","asynchronous","copy","hopper"],"matches":[{"match":"Tensor","offset":1853},{"match":"Memory","offset":1860},{"match":"Accelerator","offset":1867},{"match":"TMA","offset":1880},{"match":"Hopper","offset":1894},{"match":"memory","offset":1939},{"match":"memory","offset":1961},{"match":"tensor","offset":1987},{"match":"TMA","offset":1999},{"match":"TMA","offset":2040},{"match":"async","offset":2122},{"match":"asynchronous","offset":2173},{"match":"tensor","offset":2243},{"match":"Tensor","offset":2275},{"match":"memory","offset":2375},{"match":"tensor","offset":2403},{"match":"TMA","offset":2513},{"match":"Hopper","offset":2552},{"match":"TMA","offset":2562},{"match":"TMA","offset":2584},{"match":"TMA","offset":2630},{"match":"TMA","offset":2679},{"match":"tensor","offset":2746},{"match":"tensor","offset":2818},{"match":"Tensor","offset":2844},{"match":"tensor","offset":2901},{"match":"Tensor","offset":2931},{"match":"tensor","offset":3008},{"match":"TMA","offset":3344},{"match":"async","offset":3406},{"match":"tensor","offset":3417},{"match":"tensor","offset":3556},{"match":"tensor","offset":3607},{"match":"async","offset":3654},{"match":"async","offset":3721},{"match":"TMA","offset":3767},{"match":"TMA","offset":3956},{"match":