{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_03_tt5GUH4ZVo9VcRoLMLzn5059","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multi-Target Domain Adaptation _ MTDA (多目标域自适应).md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Target Domain Adaptation _ MTDA (多目标域自适应)\",\"score\":696.8448018502722,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-target\",\"target\",\"target=product\",\"target=clipart\",\"target=art\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Target\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Target\",\"offset\":96},{\"match\":\"Target\",\"offset\":217},{\"match\":\"target=Art\",\"offset\":738},{\"match\":\"target=Clipart\",\"offset\":801},{\"match\":\"target=Product\",\"offset\":868},{\"match\":\"Multi-Target\",\"offset\":1739}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Target Domain Adaptation / MTDA (多目标域自适应)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMulti-Target Domain Adaptation（MTDA，多目标域自适应）是域自适应（Domain Adaptation）的一个子问题：给定源域上预训练的模型，将其同时适配到多个不同的目标域（而非单一目标域）。与 Single-Target Domain Adaptation (STDA) 对应。传统 MTDA 方法主要包括：(1) 知识蒸馏方法（MTDA-KD, Nguyen-Meidine e…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton MPP (Multi-Pass Profiler).md\",\"basename\":\"Triton MPP (Multi-Pass Profiler)\",\"score\":383.8069793422285,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-pass\",\"targeted\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Pass\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Multi-Pass\",\"offset\":56},{\"match\":\"targeted\",\"offset\":1154},{\"match\":\"targeted\",\"offset\":1952}],\"excerpt\":\"## Triton MPP (Multi-Pass Profiler)\\n术语是什么？\\nTriton MPP (Multi-Pass Profiler)是Meta开发的编译器中心的统一GPU profiling框架，解决现代AI accelerator profiling的核心挑战：性能信号分散在多个abstraction layers（Triton DSL → MLIR IR → PTX/SASS → runtime APIs → hardware counters）之间，每个tool有incompatible interfaces和vendor-specific assumptions，profiling结果面向hum…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/GEMM-based Operator Chain (FFN_Gated FFN_Conv Chain) as Compute-Intensive Fusion Target（作为计算密集融合目标的G.md\",\"basename\":\"GEMM-based Operator Chain (FFN_Gated FFN_Conv Chain) as Compute-Intensive Fusion Target（作为计算密集融合目标的G\",\"score\":380.0746208805582,\"foundWords\":[\"multiply\",\"multiplication\",\"target\",\"target（作为计算密集融合目标的g\",\"target（作为计算密集融合目标的gemm算子链）\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Target（作为计算密集融合目标的GEMM算子链）\",\"offset\":84},{\"match\":\"Multiplication\",\"offset\":193},{\"match\":\"multiply\",\"offset\":1371}],\"excerpt\":\"## GEMM-based Operator Chain (FFN/Gated FFN/Conv Chain) as Compute-Intensive Fusion Target（作为计算密集融合目标的GEMM算子链）\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nGEMM-based Operator Chain 是 LLM 和 CNN 中由连续 General Matrix Multiplication (GEMM) 构成的算子序列，在 FlashFuser 论文中是 kernel fusion 的主要目标。三种典型模式：(1) Standard FFN——两个连续 GEMM（GEMM(A,B)→C → activation(如ReLU) → GEMM(C,D)→E），如 GPT/OPT/LLaMA 的 Feed-Forward Network 层；…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MQAR (Multi-Query Associative Recall).md\",\"basename\":\"MQAR (Multi-Query Associative Recall)\",\"score\":376.1299475394637,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-query\",\"target\",\"target:\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Query\",\"offset\":9},{\"match\":\"Target:\",\"offset\":364}],\"excerpt\":\"## MQAR (Multi-Query Associative Recall)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nArora et al. (2023) 提出的合成任务：上下文中多个 key-value pair，给定 query 需正确回忆对应 value。难度随序列长度和 pair 数量增加。与 in-context learning 能力相关（Elhage 2021, Olsson 2022），已成为评估新架构设计的重要基准。\\n从算法pipeline角度拆解术语，比如术语所在pipeline的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation).md\",\"basename\":\"MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation)\",\"score\":371.8803574139086,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-level\",\"target\",\"target）、linalg（线性代数操作）、sparse_tensor（稀疏张量）、gpu（gpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Level\",\"offset\":9},{\"match\":\"Multi-Level\",\"offset\":102},{\"match\":\"target）、linalg（线性代数操作）、sparse_tensor（稀疏张量）、gpu（GPU\",\"offset\":534}],\"excerpt\":\"## MLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMLIR (Multi-Level Intermediate Representation) 是 LLVM 项目的编译器基础设施，旨在提供可扩展的、支持多层抽象的编译器框架。其核心概念是 dialect：每个 dialect 定义一组具有特定语义的 operations 和 types。一个 MLIR 程序可同时包含多个 dialect，编译器通过 progressive lowering（将高层 dialect 逐步转换…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-Die Task Allocation for MoE (多Die MoE任务分配).md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Die Task Allocation for MoE (多Die MoE任务分配)\",\"score\":369.6704446692015,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-die\",\"multi-gpu-like，此算法可在\",\"multi-gpu-like\",\"target\",\"target_die\",\"target_die,\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Die\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Die\",\"offset\":97},{\"match\":\"target_die,\",\"offset\":739},{\"match\":\"target_die\",\"offset\":1446},{\"match\":\"target_die,\",\"offset\":1517},{\"match\":\"target_die\",\"offset\":1561},{\"match\":\"multi-GPU-like，此算法可在\",\"offset\":3029}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Die Task Allocation for MoE (多Die MoE任务分配)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMulti-Die Task Allocation 是运行在 wafer-scale GPU Global CP 上的启发式算法，将 MoE kernel 计算按 expert 拆分为 per-die 子任务，基于 expert 在各 die 上的分布信息和 cost model 将子任务分配到最优 die。核心创新是引入 **Candidate Mechanism**（扩展候选 die 到邻居 die，而不…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Multi-Step Overlapped Scheduler (多步重叠调度器).md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Step Overlapped Scheduler (多步重叠调度器)\",\"score\":367.64379466222965,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-step\",\"target\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Step\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Step\",\"offset\":91},{\"match\":\"Target\",\"offset\":474},{\"match\":\"Multi-step\",\"offset\":1154},{\"match\":\"Target\",\"offset\":1823}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Step Overlapped Scheduler (多步重叠调度器)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMulti-Step Overlapped Scheduler 是 LongCat-Flash 推理系统中消除 CPU 端 kernel launch bottleneck 的调度技术。在 LLM decoding 阶段（特别是 speculative decoding），单个 forward step 的 GPU 执行时间可能短于 CPU 端的 kernel launch + synchronization overh…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multi-Step Oracle Solver for VLM Agent Training.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Step Oracle Solver for VLM Agent Training\",\"score\":354.4532965019502,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multimodal\",\"multi-step\",\"target\",\"target_steps\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Step\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Step\",\"offset\":96},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":566},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":614},{\"match\":\"target_steps\",\"offset\":728},{\"match\":\"Multimodal\",\"offset\":1535}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Step Oracle Solver for VLM Agent Training\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMulti-Step Oracle Solver（多步神谕求解器）是VisGym中为每个视觉交互环境设计的启发式算法，能使用环境提供的action functions完整完成任务。Solver扮演双重角色：(1) 验证任务实例可解性；(2) 生成demonstration轨迹用于VLM的监督微调（SFT）。每个solver支持多策略（如Jigsaw的swap/reorder策略）和可选随机性（通过插入可逆pad…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) _ 多 Token 预测.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) _ 多 Token 预测\",\"score\":338.8008552539361,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-token\",\"target\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Token\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Token\",\"offset\":91},{\"match\":\"Target\",\"offset\":1563},{\"match\":\"Target\",\"offset\":1690},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":2204},{\"match\":\"Target\",\"offset\":2260},{\"match\":\"Multi-Token\",\"offset\":2436}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) / 多 Token 预测\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMulti-Token Prediction (MTP) 是一种辅助训练目标，使模型在每个位置预测多个 future token（而非仅 next token），在推理时可用作 speculative decoding 的 draft model。LongCat-Flash 采用 dense layer（非 MoE layer）作为 MTP head，在训练中期（而非全程）引入 MTP 训练。\\nLongCat-Flas…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Resource-Aware Task Dispatching (Multi-GPU).md\",\"basename\":\"Resource-Aware Task Dispatching (Multi-GPU)\",\"score\":325.6688747038787,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-gpu\",\"multi-stream\",\"target\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-GPU\",\"offset\":36},{\"match\":\"multi-GPU\",\"offset\":137},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":493},{\"match\":\"multi-stream\",\"offset\":1861}],\"excerpt\":\"## Resource-Aware Task Dispatching (Multi-GPU)\\n术语是什么？\\nResource-Aware Task Dispatching 是 HuntKTm 的 task scheduler 中的运行时调度算法，将 task 动态分配到 multi-GPU 系统中的合适设备。与简单的 round-robin 或 first-fit 分配不同，它同时考虑三个维度的 GPU 资源：memory（free memory 是否满足 task 需求）、compute（从 threads/registers/shared memory 三个子维度评估 SM 可用量）、和 hardware queue（可用的 concurrent strea…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multi-Scale Salient Attention Distillation (MSAD _ 多尺度显著注意力蒸馏).md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Scale Salient Attention Distillation (MSAD _ 多尺度显著注意力蒸馏)\",\"score\":321.4503398949818,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-scale\",\"targets\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Scale\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"global\",\"offset\":2515}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Scale Salient Attention Distillation (MSAD / 多尺度显著注意力蒸馏)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMSAD 是 QuantSparse 论文提出的在校准阶段用于对齐量化 attention 与 FP attention 的高效蒸馏框架。它解决 video DiT PTQ 中朴素联合量化和稀疏注意力产生的 \\\"amplified attention shift\\\" 问题——量化噪声与稀疏 mask 相互增强，导致 attention 分布严重偏移。MSAD 的核心思路是避免直接存储和…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Expert Generalization and Specialization in Multimodal MoE.md\",\"basename\":\"Expert Generalization and Specialization in Multimodal MoE\",\"score\":98.6450998767777,\"foundWords\":[\"multimodal\",\"target\",\"target_exp\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multimodal\",\"offset\":47},{\"match\":\"target_exp\",\"offset\":1496}],\"excerpt\":\"## Expert Generalization and Specialization in Multimodal MoE\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nExpert Generalization and Specialization 是 Flex-MoE 提出的两阶段 SMoE 训练策略，用于在 missing modality 场景下让每个 expert 同时具备通用知识和专有知识。灵感来自课程学习——先用\\\"简单\\\"样本（全模态）学习通用知识，再用\\\"困难\\\"样本（部分模态）学习专有知识。\\n- **Generalization 阶段（warm-up epochs）**：仅使用全模态样本（all modalities obse…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Catastrophic Forgetting in Multimodal MoE Fine-tuning (多模态 MoE 微调中的灾难性遗忘).md\",\"basename\":\"Catastrophic Forgetting in Multimodal MoE Fine-tuning (多模态 MoE 微调中的灾难性遗忘)\",\"score\":94.7504730707941,\"foundWords\":[\"multimodal_data:\",\"multimodal\",\"target\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multimodal\",\"offset\":30},{\"match\":\"multimodal_data:\",\"offset\":515},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":667}],\"excerpt\":\"## Catastrophic Forgetting in Multimodal MoE Fine-tuning (多模态 MoE 微调中的灾难性遗忘)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nCatastrophic Forgetting（灾难性遗忘）是指神经网络在学会新任务后，显著丧失在旧任务上已获得能力。在多模态 LLM 的上下文中，指 LLM 在全参数微调学习视觉理解等新模态时，遗忘了原有的文本理解、推理、代码、数学等能力。MoExtend 揭示了 **MoE 架构对全参数微调导致的遗忘比 dense LLM 更敏感**——这是因为 MoE 的 expert 专业化特性使每个 expert 存储…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Goodput（有效吞吐量）.md\",\"basename\":\"Goodput（有效吞吐量）\",\"score\":62.380422667674836,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multiplexing\",\"multi-slo\",\"target提至99%时，throughput\",\"target提至99\",\"target的比例。laser提升goodput\",\"target的比例\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multiplexing\",\"offset\":796},{\"match\":\"Multi-SLO\",\"offset\":865},{\"match\":\"Multi-SLO\",\"offset\":912},{\"match\":\"target的比例。Laser提升goodput\",\"offset\":1100},{\"match\":\"target提至99%时，throughput\",\"offset\":1178},{\"match\":\"multi-SLO\",\"offset\":1293}],\"excerpt\":\"- Towards High-Goodput LLM Serving with Prefill-decode Multiplexing\\n- Laser: Unlocking Layer-Level Scheduling for Efficient Multi-SLO LLM Serving\\n- AdaServe: Accelerating Multi-SLO LLM Serving with SLO-Customized Speculative Decoding\\nLaser定义goodput为**维持90% SLO attainment时达到的throughput**（区别于MuxWise的\\\"满足所有SLO约束\\\"的定义）。Laser中SLO attainment衡量decode请求P99 TBT低于…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/PredKL and AttnKL Distillation Losses（预测级和注意力级KL蒸馏损失）.md\",\"basename\":\"PredKL and AttnKL Distillation Losses（预测级和注意力级KL蒸馏损失）\",\"score\":48.46953920962874,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-head\",\"target\",\"target分布为指导\",\"target，蒸馏到较弱的\",\"target,\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"multi-head\",\"offset\":